-- GAME ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  Title       Commando
  Publisher   Elite Systems
  Version     1.1

-- YOU NEED ------------------------------------------------------------------
  Your own copy of the original game, saved beside this patch:

  File        Commando (1985)(Elite Systems)[aka Space Invasion].z80
  MD5         ddd8f28cd0db568cf6eee01945d4332c

  The patch carries none of the game's code. It only works with that exact
  dump, under that name or any other: anything else is refused, with a
  message naming the file it wants.

-- WHAT IT DOES --------------------------------------------------------------
  Moving figures become Next hardware sprites, so they keep their own colours
  and no longer take on the scenery's (colour clash). Game logic is unchanged.

  Pace        original (+0.38% measured in JNext 1.1.104 headless on the
              NextZXOS v2.09 card, against the plain build of the same start
              state; probe 39120 (once per game update), keys keyed to updates
              (QAOP, M, space); no state addresses, so lockstep not checked)

  Changes     1.1: works on NextZXOS v2.10 (System/Next 26.11); the hooks hand
              back the CPU speed the game was running at

  Note        Plays at the original's pace: +0.4% and +0.3% over 600 game
              updates (quiet thirds +1.6% and +1.2%, busy thirds +0.2% and
              -0.9%), the same as 1.0 (-0.01% against it), in JNext,
              2026-11-07. Works on NextZXOS v2.10 from 1.1. Known issues: the
              rock snipers are left as the game draws them, not as sprites
              (Dean's design), so their colour clash is not removed; one short
              stretch early in play (20 game updates, about a quarter of a
              second) ran 12% behind the original in both runs, as 1.0 did.
              Missing: no Enhanced colour set; the value-asking cheats (lives,
              grenades) are not on the menu; hardware untested.

-- MENU ----------------------------------------------------------------------
   1  Infinite lives
   2  Infinite grenades
   3  Immunity
   4  Immune to enemy touch

  Cheats come from the archive's POKEs for this release.

